              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wootu lo tung'ana laainei, entijing ilgilat linyi, ninkenikene nkutukie oo nkajijik, esudori intae maate te nkiti rishata, o metaba anaa nelusoo ina goro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu, ng'ura, kelotu Olaitoriani aipang'u te wueji enye pee elotu aitame lelo oomanya enkop te nkaraki enkarruoisho enye. Ore enkop nelo aibalunye ilo sarge apa oibukoyioki ti oriong ninye, nemeigil ae kata aitemoo lelo apa ootaraki metuata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
